   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/emilyaireyuk_vc26-aimatch-datumra-activity-7516074734569177088--m5J",
   "text": "WE\u2019VE MADE THE VC26 FINALS!!!  \n\n\ud83c\udf89AI Match has been selected as a finalist in the Lean Teams category of VC26: Datumra\n\nSuper grateful to be considered amongst an incredible line up of giant finalists.\n\nI started building AI Match in February 2026, through the help of completing the free jam packed educational 4 week accelerator run by leaders in their field at HelpBnk\n\nI'm a single mum building a business around family life, and this journey has been anything but straightforward. But with the full support of the HelpBnk community, mentoring throughout the building stages, AI software and insights from a freelance developer, I've been able to turn a scribbled down idea into a live MVP platfo",
