  "7516120915030474752": {
   "created": 1791982868,
   "author": "Ben Carden",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ben-carden-aa4a92329_in-july-anthropic-and-openai-were-worth-activity-7516120915030474752-KZS2",
   "text": "In July, Anthropic and OpenAI were worth 3.4x the next 18 American AI startups combined. In October, 2.9x.\nNeither has priced a new round since May. The 18 behind them added $83B.\nHere's America's 20 most valuable AI startups, and what moved since July:\n\n1. Anthropic, $965B. IPO pending.\n2. OpenAI, $852B. In talks at ~$1.4T.\n3. Databricks, $190B. Up 42% since July.\n4. Anduril, $61B. In talks at ~$100B.\n5. Cognition, $48B. Up 85% since July.\n6. Prometheus, $41B. Jeff Bezos' AI lab.\n7. Figure AI, $39B. Humanoid robots.\n8. Safe Superintelligence, $32B. Ilya Sutskever's lab.\n9. Scale AI, $29B. Meta owns 49%.\n10. Reflection AI, $25B. Open-weight models.\n11. Etched, $21B. Was $5B in July.\n12. Perp",
