   "text": "\ud83c\udfc6 The Podium \u2014 which startup idea more than one company is chasing\n29 ideas drew more than one company each between 17 Jul and 13 Oct. Ranked by how many COMPANIES, not how much money. The leading three:\n\ud83e\udd47 AI agents doing the work \u2014 18 companies \u00b7 $976.4m reported\nButterfly Effect, Onyx, Ema, Freehand, BUSINESSNEXT, Arrakis, Natural, Vesta, Restate, Eagle Cloud, Ghost, Zeliq, Primo, 50skills, Granite, Kontext, Itoflow, Aisot Technologies\n\ud83e\udd48 Chips built for AI \u2014 15 companies \u00b7 $4.5bn reported\nFirmus, Infinigence AI, OLIX, Etched, Xsight Labs, EUCLYD, Callosum, DeepX, Ubitium, Velatir, MintNeuro, Solinide, Embedd, HexSeed Technology, Groq\n\ud83e\udd49 Grid & energy storage \u2014 13 companies \u00b7 $872.3m reporte",
