   "author": "Tripp Conrad",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/tripp-conrad_goannacapital-gohired-talentacquisition-activity-7516226379424907265-vtOd",
   "text": "An overdue welcome to Ritap R., who joined the Goanna Capital Management Talent team last month. \n\nRitap brings experience from Etched, 1X, Meta and Tesla, working across AI, robotics and some seriously complex engineering teams.\n\nHis understanding of what makes a candidate great for a specific company is exceptional. He digs into what the team is building, who succeeds there and why. That judgment is a big part of what makes him so good at this. \n\nExcited to have him putting it to work with founders and teams across the Goanna ecosystem. \n\nGlad youre here, Ritap!\n\n#GoannaCapital #GoHired #TalentAcquisition",
